id: banner
name: Banner (persistent notice with up to two actions)
category: communication
summary: A message that stays until the person acts: a status, an offline notice, a refresh prompt. Reads at Body Medium.
requires: foundation, button
@@spec
- Container surface-3, shape large (16dp), padding 16dp, optional leading icon in a 40dp tonal circle.
- Message in Body Medium (14sp), never a dense data size. Title, if any, in Title Small.
- At most two actions: a text button for the primary, a text button for dismiss. Actions sit under the text on phones, to the end on wide screens.
- Push content down rather than overlaying it.
- Use for things the person should keep seeing. Short confirmations belong in a snackbar.
@@a11y
- role="region" with aria-label for a general notice, or role="status" when it appears after load and is informational. Use role="alert" only for urgent, error-level notices.
- The icon is aria-hidden. Meaning is in the text, not the icon color.
- Dismiss is a named button ("Dismiss").
@@html
<section class="md-banner" role="region" aria-label="Update available">
  <span class="md-banner__icon"><span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">info</span></span>
  <div class="md-banner__content">
    <h2 class="md-banner__title">A new version is ready</h2>
    <p class="md-banner__text">Refresh to get the latest prices and fixes. Your layout is kept.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="md-banner__actions">
    <button class="md-btn md-btn--text" type="button">Dismiss</button>
    <button class="md-btn md-btn--text" type="button">Refresh</button>
  </div>
</section>
@@css
.md-banner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
  gap: var(--sp-md) var(--sp-lg);
  align-items: start;
  padding: var(--sp-lg);
  border-radius: var(--shape-lg);
  background: var(--md-surface-3);
  color: var(--md-on-surface);
}

.md-banner__icon {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 2.5rem;
  height: 2.5rem;
  border-radius: var(--shape-full);
  background: var(--md-secondary-container);
  color: var(--md-on-secondary-container);
}

.md-banner__title {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: var(--md-type-title-small-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-title-small-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-title-small-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-title-small-tracking);
}

.md-banner__text {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-medium-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-medium-tracking);
}

.md-banner__actions {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: var(--sp-sm);
}

@media (min-width: 40rem) {
  .md-banner { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: center; }
  .md-banner__actions { grid-column: auto; }
}
